%% Human Review Loop
flowchart LR
    Q[Review Queue] --> Sort[Sort by<br/>priority + age]
    Sort --> Assign[Skill-Matched<br/>+ Workload-Balanced<br/>Assignment]
    Assign --> Rev[Reviewer]
    Rev --> Decision{Decision}
    Decision -- Remove --> Action[Remove Content<br/>+ Notify User]
    Decision -- Approve --> Pub[Publish Content]
    Decision -- Unsure --> Senior[Senior Reviewer]
    Decision -- Appeal --> AppealQ[Appeals Queue<br/>different reviewer]
    Action --> Labels[(Label Store)]
    Pub --> Labels
    Senior --> Labels
    AppealQ --> Labels
